From b57bbf70bf9cf993f346cf28184f93b16cd759a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OLS-cPanel-WHM <2tdv@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 23:05:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Accept the autoDetectCdn server directive

httpserver.cpp reads autoDetectCdn, but the plain configuration keyword
table did not include it, so the setting was rejected as unsupported and
CDN ranges were always added to the trusted ACL.
---
 src/main/plainconf.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/main/plainconf.cpp b/src/main/plainconf.cpp
index 4ab8e92..8802f4c 100644
--- a/src/main/plainconf.cpp
+++ b/src/main/plainconf.cpp
@@ -72,6 +72,7 @@ plainconfKeywords plainconf::sKeywords[] =
     {"authname",                                 NULL},
     {"authorizer",                               NULL},
     {"autofix503",                               NULL},
+    {"autodetectcdn",                            NULL},
     {"autoindex",                                NULL},
     {"autoindexuri",                             NULL},
     {"autorestart",                              NULL},
